cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite the paper below.
title: Vibe Building
abstract: >-
  We introduce the Vibe Building task and propose PE-Loop (Physics-Engine-in-the-Loop),
  an agent in which a deterministic physics engine is the sole source of evaluation
  signals, while the language model is confined to proposing discrete revisions.
